        ]
      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}16\\pi &= \\frac{1}{2}r^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\\\r^2 &= 256\\\\r &= 16\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\nThe radius is positive.\n$$\\begin{align*}l &= 16\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\\\l &= 2\\pi\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
